{"seq":3,"slug":"consolidation-warehouse","title":"集运仓模式与中转集货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/consolidation-model/consolidation-warehouse","wordCount":2386,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"集运仓模式与中转集货\">集运仓模式与中转集货</h1><p>如果合单只能在「同一次拣货、同一个发货地」发生，那么它能合的订单比例会低得没有商业价值——绝大多数买家的多笔订单来自不同产地、不同卖家、不同发货仓。<strong>集运仓（consolidation warehouse）把这些分散的起点收敛到一个中转节点，让原本不可能合的单变得可合。</strong> 它的代价是多了一段「入库—上架—等待—合包」的作业与时间，这段作业的效率与它带来的合单率之间的比例，决定了整条业务是否成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>集运仓是跨境链路上的一个<strong>中转收敛点</strong>：不同卖家、不同产地的货先各自走境内段汇集到这里，登记入库，等待同一买家的其他货到齐，然后按买家维度合包，统一走跨境段。它与传统海外仓的方向恰好相反——海外仓是「提前备货到目的国附近」，集运仓是「出发前在国内/出发国附近聚货」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>集运仓</th>\n<th>海外仓</th>\n<th>直发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>位置</td>\n<td>出发国（收件人所在国境外）</td>\n<td>目的国境内</td>\n<td>卖家仓直发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要作用</td>\n<td>聚货合包，降低跨境段次数</td>\n<td>就近发货，缩短时效</td>\n<td>无中间环节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合单能力</td>\n<td>强（跨卖家、跨产地）</td>\n<td>中（同目的国合包）</td>\n<td>弱（仅同期拣货）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效贡献</td>\n<td>负（增加等待与入出库时长）</td>\n<td>正（尾程极短）</td>\n<td>中性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本贡献</td>\n<td>增加作业与仓储成本，减少跨境段成本</td>\n<td>增加仓储成本，减少跨境段与尾程成本</td>\n<td>无中间成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型适用</td>\n<td>多卖家、多产地、低时效敏感</td>\n<td>高时效敏感、周转快的畅销品</td>\n<td>单卖家、单件、高时效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>集运仓的存在理由可以用一句话概括：<strong>它用一次可控的境内作业成本，换掉多次不可控的跨境运输成本。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[卖家1仓] --&gt; D[境内承运]&#10;    B[卖家2仓] --&gt; D&#10;    C[卖家3仓] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[集运仓收货口]&#10;    E --&gt; F[扫描入库 登记货权与归属]&#10;    F --&gt; G[上架至买家暂存位]&#10;    G --&gt; H{同一买家的货是否到齐}&#10;    H --&gt;|未齐| I[等待 记录等待时长]&#10;    I --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt;|已齐或触发先发| J[合包拣货]&#10;    J --&gt; K[打包 称重 计费重]&#10;    K --&gt; L[生成母包与子包明细]&#10;    L --&gt; M[出库 交跨境承运商]\">graph TD\n    A[卖家1仓] --&gt; D[境内承运]\n    B[卖家2仓] --&gt; D\n    C[卖家3仓] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[集运仓收货口]\n    E --&gt; F[扫描入库 登记货权与归属]\n    F --&gt; G[上架至买家暂存位]\n    G --&gt; H{同一买家的货是否到齐}\n    H --&gt;|未齐| I[等待 记录等待时长]\n    I --&gt; H\n    H --&gt;|已齐或触发先发| J[合包拣货]\n    J --&gt; K[打包 称重 计费重]\n    K --&gt; L[生成母包与子包明细]\n    L --&gt; M[出库 交跨境承运商]</pre><h2 id=\"作业流程与它的时间成本\">作业流程与它的时间成本</h2><p>集运仓的作业链由五段组成，每一段都贡献时延，也都可以成为瓶颈。</p>\n<p><strong>收货与登记</strong>：每一件到仓的货都要与卖家申报的货对应上——扫描包裹条码，关联到订单与买家暂存位，登记实际重量体积（用于后续计费重计算，见 <a href=\"../merge-savings/weight-volume-combine\">合包重量/体积重合并计费</a>），并做<strong>内容物抽检或全检</strong>。这一步是合单的物理入口，也是数据质量的源头：入仓时录错的重量体积会一直错到计费与清关申报。</p>\n<p><strong>上架与暂存</strong>：货按<strong>买家维度</strong>聚合到一个暂存位（而不是按 SKU 或按卖家维度），因为合包决策的粒度是买家。这与常规仓「按品类/周转率上架」的库位策略相反，是集运仓区别于普通仓的第一个结构特征。它带来的直接后果是暂存位数量与买家数成正比而非与 SKU 数成正比，因此集运仓的库位规划要按买家并发量做容量模型。</p>\n<p><strong>等待（dwell time）</strong>：这是集运仓最独特的阶段，也是最需要被管理的阶段。一件货在暂存位上等多久，取决于「同一买家其他货什么时候到」与「承诺时效还剩多少」。等待本身不产生作业成本，但产生三笔成本：仓储占位、资金占用、买家体验损失。等待的终止条件有两种——货齐了，或者触发了「不再等」（见 <a href=\"../merge-conflict/partial-ship-decision\">部分到货先发 vs 等齐</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>合包作业</strong>：拣出该买家暂存位上的所有货，按混装禁忌与包装要求打包成一个母包。这一步要与第一章第 2 篇的子包明细登记同时完成，因为母包一旦离开仓库，其内部结构就只能靠这份明细还原。</p>\n<p><strong>出库与交接</strong>：称重、量体积、计算计费重、选择渠道、生成面单、交跨境承运商。这一步的产出同时进入三条链路：计费（第二章）、追踪（第四章）、清关申报（第四章第 3 篇）。</p>\n<p>各段的时延量级差异很大，且都可以被压缩，但压缩的成本不同：收货段的瓶颈通常是人力（可临时加人），上架段是库位与动线（改布局），等待段是决策规则（改策略最便宜、效果最大），合包段是工位效率，出库段是与承运商的交接频率（改班次）。<strong>等待段是唯一一段「越短越好的成本项又是收益项」的环节</strong>——缩短等待会降低合单率，拉长等待会恶化时效，这一取舍与第三章第 3 篇的决策模型是同一个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仓库选址与容量模型\">仓库选址与容量模型</h2><p>集运仓的选址与数量是一个典型的<strong>设施选址问题</strong>，但它的目标函数与常规仓不同。常规仓选址优化「到客户的运输成本 + 建仓成本」，集运仓要额外考虑<strong>合单率对选址的反作用</strong>。</p>\n<p>给候选选址 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span>，定义三个量：聚合到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 的订单出发地集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、这些订单能形成的合单率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、以及建仓与作业的固定成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 的净收益为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mtext>利用率</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pi_l = \\mu_l \\cdot \\Delta C_{cross}(O_l) - \\sum_{i \\in O_l} C^{inland}_i(l) - F_l \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\text{利用率}_l}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4502em;vertical-align:-1.4002em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4002em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">利用率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C_{cross}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是合单在跨境段省下的单位成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{inland}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1078em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 的境内段成本（这部分会因为绕路而增加）。</p>\n<p>这个式子里藏着一个反直觉的结论：<strong>集运仓不一定要建在货源地最密集的地方。</strong> 建在货源地密集处会最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{inland}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但若那里卖家的发货节奏高度分散，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反而低；而建在一个「多条产地路线交汇、班次密度高」的中转城市，可以同时拿到较低的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{inland}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（因为干线密度高、单价低）与较高的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（因为不同卖家的货在同一时间窗内到达的概率更高）。枢纽型选址的另一个好处是出口航班密度高，跨境段的班次选择多，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 更短且更稳定。</p>\n<p>容量模型的输入是<strong>买家并发峰值</strong>而非日均单量，因为暂存位的占用时长是等待时长。一个粗略但是常用的估算是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>日均到仓件数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>平均等待时长(天)</mtext></mrow><mtext>利用率上限</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{slots} \\approx \\frac{\\text{日均到仓件数} \\times \\text{平均等待时长(天)}}{\\text{利用率上限}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">利用率上限</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日均到仓件数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均等待时长</span><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>大促期间日均单量可能翻数倍，等待时长也可能因为「买家下单更集中、合单率上升」而变化，两个因子同时上升会把容量需求推向平方级增长。因此集运仓的容量规划必须做<strong>峰值场景的联合假设</strong>，而不是把两个峰值独立相乘——这与第四章第 2 篇讨论的状态回传一样，都是要在大促这类极端场景下不崩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集运仓的数据模型要点\">集运仓的数据模型要点</h2><p>集运仓在数据上引入了三类普通仓没有的实体与状态。</p>\n<p><strong>到仓件（inbound unit）</strong>：以「一件货 = 一个订单行」为粒度，携带归属买家、归属订单、归属卖家、重量体积、抽检结论。它是母子包映射中「子包」的前身。</p>\n<p><strong>暂存位（staging slot）</strong>：以买家为维度的聚合容器，有占用与释放的生命周期。一个买家的暂存位可能被跨越多天使用，期间有货进出。</p>\n<p><strong>等待记录（dwell record）</strong>：进入暂存位的时间、每次有新货到仓时的重算、触发合包或触发先发的时间与理由。这份记录是第三章第 3 篇做「先发 vs 等齐」决策的数据基础，也是事后解释「为什么这一单等了 6 天」的唯一依据。</p>\n<p>这三类实体的共同点是<strong>它们都有明确的时间维度</strong>，且时间维度是业务语义的一部分而非审计附属。这与普通库存实体的建模习惯不同：普通库存关心「有多少」，集运仓的实体关心「从什么时候起、等谁、等多久」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>集运仓用一次可控的境内作业成本，换掉多次不可控的跨境运输成本；它把合单从「同期拣货」扩展为「跨卖家、跨产地、跨时间」。</li>\n<li>作业链五段（收货登记、上架暂存、等待、合包、出库交接）各自贡献时延；等待段是唯一同时是成本项与收益项的环节，其长短直接决定合单率与时效。</li>\n<li>库位按买家维度聚合暂存位，使库位需求与买家并发数而非 SKU 数成正比；容量模型要按「日均件数 × 平均等待时长」，并对大促做峰值联合假设。</li>\n<li>选址不应只看货源地密度：枢纽型选址能以更低的干线单价与更稳定的班次换取更高的合单率与更短的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>数据模型引入到仓件、暂存位、等待记录三类带时间语义的实体；等待记录是「先发 vs 等齐」决策与事后解释的唯一依据。</li>\n<li>到仓时登记的重量体积是计费重的源头，见 <a href=\"../merge-savings/weight-volume-combine\">合包重量/体积重合并计费</a>；等待的终止规则见 <a href=\"../merge-conflict/partial-ship-decision\">部分到货先发 vs 等齐</a>；母包与子包明细的结构见 <a href=\"../consolidation-tracking/master-child-package\">母包子包裹映射追踪</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"集运仓模式与中转集货","id":"集运仓模式与中转集货"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"作业流程与它的时间成本","id":"作业流程与它的时间成本"},{"level":2,"text":"仓库选址与容量模型","id":"仓库选址与容量模型"},{"level":2,"text":"集运仓的数据模型要点","id":"集运仓的数据模型要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨店铺订单合发可行性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/consolidation-model/cross-seller-merge"},"next":{"title":"合单运费节省与门槛计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-savings/freight-savings-calc"}}